Package: tlbstacks
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, plasma-workspace, qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami, python3
Description: Application launchers, configurable stacks, live menus, and task management for KDE Plasma 6
 TLBStacks provides KDE Plasma 6 widgets for launching and organizing
 applications. The main widget, TLBStacks Groups, organizes applications
 into compact launcher groups with individual launchers, configurable
 stacks, live menus, and task management for running windows. The
 standalone TLBStacks widget provides a single configurable stack.
